  "prefLabel": "Agr 103.04 Division of Animal Industry",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 103.04 Division of Animal Industry. The division of animal industry shall be responsible for the control and eradication of all contagious and infectious diseases of domestic animals and poultry in the state. It shall protect people, livestock and poultry from disease through testing, vaccination and regulation of entry of animals and poultry into New Hampshire. The division shall enforce the humane laws of the state, and liaise with appropriate local and federal agencies in animal health matters.\n\nSource. #6012, eff 3-28-95",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/agr100.html"
